caption: Universal Origin Rule
tradition-component: universal-origin-rule

Every non-Talent trait purchased through Revelator follows the Eldritch Gifts Universal Origin Rule. Before an explicit Mastery conversion, it therefore has both Psionic, -10%, and Super, -10%.
